// * Control: the same lifted by hand in the lifter's shape (a body function taking the captures and
// * parameters, plus a curried wrapper forwarding to it), without the lifter, in poly mode.
#config(liftDefns: None, flowBasedOpt: Some(FlowBasedOpt(mono: false, debugDpe: true, debugDead: true)))
//│ dead-param-elim > >>> dead-param-elim results >>>
