// * FIXME (diff tests only): dead-parameter elimination passes `undefined` for a dropped parameter, and here it
// * ends up in the unused first element of the tuple. The result is right, but the pattern `[s, a]` still reads
// * that element, and the sanity checks reject a call returning `undefined`. (Dead-read elimination would remove that read
// * and hide the problem, so it is off here.)
#config(liftDefns: None, flowBasedOpt: Some(FlowBasedOpt(mono: false, inferAffine: false, deadReadElim: false, debugDpe: true)))
